hadiths[241]{hadithnumber,text}:
"6742","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhari ye aag jo ibne Adam jalate hain, jahannam ki aag ke sattar hisson mein se ek hissa hai. Arz kiya gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kya ye kaafi nahi thi? Aap ne farmaya: Us par unhattar hisse fazil hain, un sab ki garmi isi jaisi hai."
"6743","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhari ye aag jahannam ki aag ke sattar hisson mein se ek hissa hai, us ke har hisse ki garmi isi jaisi hai."
"6744","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke kuch log mujhe dikhaye gaye jo Allah ki raah mein jang kar rahe hain aur is samundar ki pusht par sawar ho kar takhton par badshahon ki tarah hain."
"6745","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hum us se shuru karte hain jis se Allah ne shuru kiya."
"6746","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is ummat ka awwal yaqeen aur zuhd se bach gaya aur aakhir bakhil aur ummeed se halak hoga."
"6747","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalmanon ke raaste se takleef hatao."
"6748","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main ne yahan zibah kiya aur Mina pura zibah karne ki jagah hai, pas apni jagahon par zibah karo; aur main ne yahan waqoof kiya aur Arfa pura waqoof ki jagah hai; aur main ne yahan waqoof kiya aur Muzdalifa pura waqoof ki jagah hai."
"6749","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hum aakhri ummat hain aur hisab mein sab se pehle honge. Kaha jayega: Ummi ummat aur us ka nabi kahan hai? Pas hum aakhri aur pehle hain."
"6750","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hum Ibrahim se zyada shak ke haqdar hain jab unhon ne kaha: Ae mere Rab, mujhe dikha tu murdon ko kaise zinda karta hai. Allah ne kaha: Kya tu iman nahi rakhta? Us ne kaha: Kyun nahi, lekin taake mera dil mutmain ho jaye. Aur Allah Lut par reham kare, wo sakht sahare ki taraf jaate the. Aur agar main Yusuf ke qaid mein utne din rehta jitne wo rahe to main bulane wale ko jawab de deta."
"6751","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hum tum se zyada Musa ke haqdar aur qareeb hain."
"6752","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hum aakhri hain jo qayamat ke din aage honge; halanke unhein hum se pehle kitab di gayi aur humein un ke baad di gayi; phir ye un ka din hai jo Allah ne un par farz kiya tha to unhon ne us mein ikhtilaf kiya, pas Allah ne humein us ki hidayat di; pas log is mein humare peechhe hain: yahudi kal aur nasrani parson."
"6753","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hum Nadr bin Kinana ki aulad hain, na hum apni maa ko bura kehte hain na apne baap se inkar karte hain."
"6754","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hum kal Bani Kinana ki wadi ke kinare utrenge jahan Quraysh ne kufr par qasam khai thi."
"6755","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ek aadmi ne jis ne kabhi koi neki nahi ki, raaste se kanton ki tehni hatayi, chahe wo kate hue darakht par thi to us ne phenk di, ya raaste par padi thi to us ne hata di, Allah ne us ka shukr kiya aur use jannat mein dakhil kar diya."
"6756","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hajar-e-Aswad jannat se utra hai aur wo doodh se zyada safed tha, magar ibne Adam ke gunahon ne use kala kar diya."
"6757","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jibreel utre aur mujhe imam banaya, phir main ne un ke saath namaz padhi, phir un ke saath, phir un ke saath, phir un ke saath, phir un ke saath, phir kaha: Isi ka mujhe hukum diya gaya hai."
"6758","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aasman se ek farishta utra aur us ne us ki takzib ki jo us ne tum se kaha; phir jab main ghalib aaya to Shaitan gir gaya; aur jab Shaitan girta hai to main baithne wala nahi hun."
"6759","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ek nabi ne kisi darakht ke neeche dera dala to unhein cheenti ne danka; unhon ne apna saman uthane ka hukum diya aur us ke neeche se nikal gaye; phir us ke bil ka hukum diya aur usay jala diya; to Allah ne un ki taraf wahy ki: Kyun na sirf ek cheenti ko?"
"6760","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye aayat Quba walon ke baare mein nazil hui: Us mein aise log hain jo paak rehna pasand karte hain, aur Allah paak rehne walon ko pasand karta hai."
"6761","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hum sabr karte hain aur badla nahi lete."
"6762","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe pichhli hawa se madad di gayi aur Aad ko pachhli hawa se halak kiya gaya."
"6763","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah us shakhs ko taza rakhe jo hum se koi hadith sune aur usay yaad rakhe yahan tak ke doosre ko pahuncha de; kyunke bahut se fiqh uthane wale khud faqeeh nahi hote, aur bahut se fiqh uthane wale us se zyada samajhne wale ke paas pahunchate hain."
"6764","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah us shakhs ko taza rakhe jo hum se kuch sune aur jaisa suna waisa hi pahuncha de; kyunke bahut se pahunchane wale sunne wale se zyada samajhdaar hote hain."
"6765","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah us bande ko taza rakhe jo meri baat sune, usay samajh le phir meri taraf se pahuncha de; kyunke bahut se fiqh uthane wale khud faqeeh nahi hote aur bahut se fiqh uthane wale us se zyada samajhne wale ke paas pahunchate hain."
"6766","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah us bande ko taza rakhe jo meri baat sune, usay samajh le aur yaad rakhe, phir use us tak pahuncha de jis ne wo baat nahi suni; kyunke bahut se fiqh uthane wale khud faqeeh nahi hote aur bahut se fiqh uthane wale us se zyada samajhne wale ke paas pahunchate hain. Teen cheezon par kisi Musalman ke dil mein khot nahi hota: Allah ke liye amal ki ikhlas, Musalmanon ke imamon ki khairkhwahi, aur un ki jamaat ko lazmi pakadna; kyunke un ki dawat un ke peechhe se gher leti hai."
"6767","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mard ka nutfa safed aur gaadha hai aur aurat ka nutfa peela aur patla; pas un donon mein se jo ghalib ho us par bachcha mushabih hota hai,....... ..."
"6768","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen salan sirka hai."
"6769","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen jihad Hajj hai."
"6770","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya achhe aadmi hain Abu Bakr, kya achhe aadmi hain Umar, kya achhe aadmi hain Abu Ubaida bin Jarrah, kya achhe aadmi hain Usaid bin Hudair, kya achhe aadmi hain Thabit bin Qais bin Shammas, kya achhe aadmi hain Muadh bin Jabal, kya achhe aadmi hain Muadh bin Amr bin Jamuh, kya achhe aadmi hain Suhail bin Baida."
"6771","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya achhe aadmi hain Abdullah, kaash wo raat ko namaz padhte."
"6772","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Behtareen sehri khajoor hai."
"6773","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya achhi do sooraten hain jo Fajr se pehle do rakaaton mein padhi jati hain: Qul ya ayyuhal kafirun aur Qul huwallahu ahad."
"6774","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya achha sadqa hai doodh dene wali oontni ka tohfa aur doodh dene wali bakri ka tohfa; wo subah ek bartan le kar jati hai aur shaam ek bartan le kar aati hai."
"6775","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya achhi maut hai ke aadmi apne haq ke baghair mare."
"6776","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya achhe bande hain Khalid bin Waleed, Allah ki talwaron mein se ek talwar."
"6777","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya achha hai ghulam ke liye ke wo faut ho jaye, apne Rab ki ibadat achhi kare aur apne aaqa ki khairkhwahi kare; kya achha hai us ke liye."
"6778","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do naimaten hain jin mein bahut log dhoka khate hain: tandurusti aur faraghat."
"6779","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ki jaan us ke qarz se latki rehti hai yahan tak ke us ki taraf se ada kar diya jaye."
"6780","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ka apne ghar walon par kharch sadqa hai."
"6781","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hum un ke ahad ko poora karte hain aur un ke khilaf Allah se madad maangte hain."
"6782","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jannat ki do nadiyan: Nile aur Furaat."
"6783","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe nanga chalne se mana kiya gaya hai."
"6784","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe nange hone se mana kiya gaya hai."
"6785","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe namaz padhne walon ko takleef dene se mana kiya gaya hai."
"6786","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe naye bartanon se mana kiya gaya tha; aur bartan kisi halal ko haram nahi karte aur kisi haram ko halal nahi karte; aur har nasha haram hai."
"6787","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe nabeeth se mana kiya gaya tha siwaye mashki ke; pas tum tamam mashkiyon mein piyo aur nasha na karo."
"6788","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe teen cheezon se mana kiya gaya tha aur main tumhein un ka hukum deta hun: Mujhe qabron ki ziyarat se mana kiya gaya tha, pas ab ziyarat karo kyunke us mein yaad-dehani hai; aur mujhe mashroobon se mana kiya gaya tha ke tum sirf chamde ke bartan mein piyo, pas ab har bartan mein piyo magar nasha na karo; aur mujhe qurbani ke gosht se mana kiya gaya tha ke teen din ke baad khao, pas ab khao aur apne safron mein us se faida uthao."
"6789","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe qabron ki ziyarat se mana kiya gaya tha, pas ab ziyarat karo kyunke us mein tumhare liye ibrat hai."
"6790","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe qabron ki ziyarat se mana kiya gaya tha, pas ab ziyarat karo kyunke ye tumhein maut yaad dilati hai."
"6791","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hum namaz mein Quran aur zikr ke siwaye baat karne se mana kiye gaye hain."
"6792","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Noha karne wali aurat agar marne se pehle tauba na kare to qayamat ke din uthai jayegi aur us par qatran ka libaas aur kharish ki zirah hogi."
"6793","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag sakht zor-awari wali hai."
"6794","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aag dushman hai, pas us se bacho."
"6795","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Log Quraysh ke peechhe hain khair aur shar mein."
"6796","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Log maaden hain; jahiliyat mein un ke behtar log Islam mein bhi behtar hain jab wo deen ko samjhein; log is maamle mein Quraysh ke peechhe hain: un ka Musalman un ke Musalman ke peechhe aur un ka kafir un ke kafir ke peechhe; tum logon mein sab se behtar usay paoge jo is maamle se sab se zyada nafrat kare yahan tak ke wo us mein dakhil ho jaye."
"6797","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Log maaden hain jaise sone aur chandi ke maaden; jahiliyat mein un ke behtar log Islam mein bhi behtar hain jab wo deen ko samjhein; aur roohain lashkaron ki tarah jama ki hui hain, pas jo ek doosre ko pehchane wo mil jati hain aur jo ek doosre se mukhalifat kare wo alag ho jati hain."
"6798","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Log Adam ki aulad hain aur Adam mitti se hain."
"6799","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nabi ka koi waris nahi hota."
"6800","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sitare aasman ki amaan hain; pas jab sitare chale jayenge to aasman par wo aa jayega jis ka wada kiya gaya hai; aur main apne sahaba ki amaan hun; pas jab main chala jaunga to mere sahaba par wo aa jayega jis ka un se wada kiya gaya hai; aur mere sahaba meri ummat ki amaan hain; pas jab mere sahaba chale jayenge to meri ummat par wo aa jayega jis ka un se wada kiya gaya hai."
"6801","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Masjid mein balgham phenkna gunah hai aur us ka kaffara use dafn karna hai."
"6802","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nadamat tauba hai."
"6803","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nadamat tauba hai, aur gunah se tauba karne wala aise hai jaise us ne gunah kiya hi na ho."
"6804","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nazar do qism ki hoti hai: jo nazar Allah ki itaat mein ho wo Allah ke liye hai aur use poora karna chahiye; aur jo nazar Allah ki nafarmani mein ho wo Shaitan ki taraf se hai aur use poora karna nahi chahiye, aur us ka kaffara qasam ka kaffara hai."
"6805","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nazar.... us ka kaffara qasam ka kaffara hai."
"6806","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nusrat sabr ke saath hai aur rahat takleef ke saath hai; aur beshak mushkil ke saath aasani hai."
"6807","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Nikah meri sunnat hai; pas jo meri sunnat par amal na kare wo mujh se nahi; shadi karo kyunke qayamat ke din main tumhari kasrat par fakhr karunga; jis ke paas maal ho wo shadi kare aur jis ke paas na ho use roza rakhna chahiye, kyunke roza us ki shahwat ko todta hai."
"6808","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Neend maut ki behen hai aur jannat wale nahi marte."
"6809","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mayyat par noha karna jaahiliyat ka kaam hai; aur beshak noha karne wali agar marne se pehle tauba na kare to qayamat ke din uthai jayegi aur us par qatran ke libaas honge, phir us par aag ke sholon ki zirahen pehna kar ubal diya jayega."
"6810","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mana farmaya ke aise janaze ke saath jaya jaye jis ke saath rone ki awaaz ho."
"6811","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne deewaron ko parda karne se mana farmaya."
"6812","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne janwaron ko nishana bana kar bandhne se mana farmaya."
"6813","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mana farmaya ke aurton se baat ki jaye siwaye un ke shauharon ki ijazat ke."
"6814","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne bahe hue pani mein peshab karne se mana farmaya."
"6815","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aadmi ke gusl khane mein peshab karne se mana farmaya."
"6816","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne logon ke masjidon mein fakhr karne se mana farmaya."
"6817","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne kisi jaan wali cheez ko nishana banane se mana farmaya."
"6818","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aadmi ke zafaran lagane se mana farmaya."
"6819","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne nangi talwar ke saath ek doosre ki taraf badhne se mana farmaya."
"6820","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne bartan mein saans lene ya us mein phoonkne se mana farmaya."
"6821","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aadmi ke do aadmiyon ke darmiyan un ki ijazat ke baghair baithne se mana farmaya."
"6822","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mana farmaya ke aadmi namaz mein apne bayen haath par tek lagaye hue baithe aur farmaya: Ye yahudiyon ki namaz hai."
"6823","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne dhoop aur chhaon ke darmiyan baithne se mana farmaya aur farmaya: Ye Shaitan ki majlis hai."
"6824","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mana farmaya ke koi apna naam aur kunniyat mila kar rakhe."
"6825","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne Quran ko dushman ki zameen tak safar mein le jane se mana farmaya."
"6826","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne haddi, gobar ya koyla se istinja karne se mana farmaya."
"6827","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne gobar ya haddi se istinja karne se mana farmaya."
"6828","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne chaar naam rakhne se mana farmaya: Aflah, Yasar, Nafi aur Rabah."
"6829","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aadmi ke khade ho kar pani peene se mana farmaya."
"6830","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aadmi ke aisi chadar mein namaz padhne se mana farmaya jise wo lapete baghair ho, aur aadmi ke sirf tehband mein namaz padhne se mana farmaya jab us par chadar na ho."
"6831","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aadmi ke baal bandhe hue sir ke saath namaz padhne se mana farmaya."
"6832","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aadmi ke peshab rok kar namaz padhne se mana farmaya."
"6833","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne baat karne wale aur sone wale ke peechhe namaz padhne se mana farmaya."
"6834","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne qabron ke darmiyan janazon par namaz padhne se mana farmaya."
"6835","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aadmi ke apne peeth ke bal let kar ek paon doosre par rakhne se mana farmaya."
"6836","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aadmi ke raat ko baghair ittila ke apne ghar walon ke paas aane se mana farmaya."
"6837","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne sirf Jumma ke din roza rakhne se mana farmaya."
"6838","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aadmi ko us ki jagah se utha kar doosre ke baithne se mana farmaya."
"6839","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne kisi janwar ko bandh kar qatl karne se mana farmaya."
"6840","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aadmi ke chhaon aur dhoop ke darmiyan baithne se mana farmaya."
"6841","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne qabr par baithne, us par gach lagane ya us par imarat banane se mana farmaya."
"6842","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne imam ke kisi cheez par buland khade hone se mana farmaya jabke log us ke peechhe hon."
"6843","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne qabr par kuch likhne se mana farmaya."
"6844","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aadmi ke apne daayein haath se apni sharamgah ko chhune, ek joota pehn kar chalne, chadar ko aise lapetne ke donon haath bahar na hon, aur aisi chadar mein baithne se mana farmaya jis mein us ki sharamgah khuli ho."
"6845","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aadmi ke ek joota ya ek moza pehn kar chalne se mana farmaya."
"6846","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne kuen ka pani rokne se mana farmaya."
"6847","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aadmi ke aisi chhat par sone se mana farmaya jis par koi deewar ya parda na ho."
"6848","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne aadmi ke khade ho kar jute pehnne se mana farmaya."
"6849","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mashroob mein phoonkne aur piyale ke kinare ya us ke handle se peene se mana farmaya."
"6850","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne khane aur peene mein phoonkne se mana farmaya, ... ..."
"6851","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne mashkiyon ka munh mod kar peene se mana farmaya."
"6852","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne pyaz khane se mana farmaya."
"6853","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne pyaz, gandhana aur lehsun khane se mana farmaya."
"6854","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne lehsun khane se mana farmaya."
"6855","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne jallala ka gosht khane aur us ka doodh peene se mana farmaya?"
"6856","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne sahsi khane se mana farmaya."
"6857","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne us janwar ko khane se mana farmaya jo teeron se nishana bana kar bandha gaya ho."
"6858","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne har nukheel darinda ke khane se mana farmaya."
"6859","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne har nukheel darinda aur panja wale parinde ke khane se mana farmaya."
